SUMMARY:Trivia Night @ Twin Leaf Brewery!
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\n**Trivia night at Twin Leaf Brewery!**\n
 \nHey all\, we are trying out an old spot for trivia! If you've got that i
 tch to show you know it all (or just want to have some weekday fun) then c
 ome on out!\n\nThe trivia actually starts at "6:30" but I will be there ea
 rlier to grab a table.
